ong>deck building</strong> into a low-input and competitive experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategize against another team in <strong>online versus multiplayer</strong> for deep, emergent gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join friends in a <strong>cooperative roguelite</strong> to outwit encounters, forge a path, and explore the World Beasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together to perform <strong>exciting combos</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796970/extras/09093257da2089e559023c1b379b4251.poster.avif?t=1753125482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796970/extras/09093257da2089e559023c1b379b4251.webm?t=1753125482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1796970/extras/09093257da2089e559023c1b379b4251.mp4?t=1753125482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 playable characters with their own mechanics and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expansive card libraries unique to each character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Innovative mechanics offer a rich new way to build decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple immersive World Beasts to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of status effects</p></li></ul>",
